    <briefdescription>
<para>Compile-time reflection for wrapper types. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides the macros and types needed to generate proxy members that transparently forward calls from a wrapper to the held object through an executor, preserving all cv-ref qualifiers.</para>
<para><table rows="4" cols="2"><row>
<entry thead="yes"><para>Symbol   </para>
</entry><entry thead="yes"><para>Purpose    </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para><computeroutput><ref refid="group__scl__feature__reflection_1ga04334714025d2e271f8c953464c5382d" kindref="member">SCL_REFLECT_TYPE(Wrapper, Executor)</ref></computeroutput>   </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>Declares the type aliases required by <computeroutput>SCL_REFLECT_METHOD</computeroutput>. Must appear first inside the wrapper class body.    </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para><computeroutput><ref refid="method_8h_1ad31abde82c30312cad7dc6b7bb5ae532" kindref="member">SCL_REFLECT_METHOD(method)</ref></computeroutput>   </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>Generates 24 proxy overloads (3 × 8 cv-ref) that dispatch through the executor.    </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para><computeroutput><ref refid="classscl_1_1feature_1_1reflect" kindref="compound">scl::feature::reflect</ref></computeroutput>   </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>CRTP mixin base class; specialisations inject reflected members.   </para>
</entry></row>
</table>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
